{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Prince and the\u00a0Servant\u00a0join the Reckless Squad!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After unlocking the <strong>Rune Workshop</strong>, send a team into battle carrying the Prince\u2019s four cards and defeat a <strong>final boss of difficulty 2 or higher</strong> \u2014 you\u2019ll then be able to <strong>recruit the Prince and his Servant from the Tavern!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116980/extras/7d5cf3ed36519960a97eeb541b1f19e5.avif?t=1761876268\" width=800 height=249 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A brand-new standalone character mechanic: Radiance &amp; Wrath!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack <strong>Radiance\u00a0</strong>layers to consume<strong>\u00a0Wrath</strong>, unleashing powerful Radiance damage \u2014 and even igniting the ground with a burning effect!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116980/extras/e05f9955484e7276d62f05739172e989.poster.avif?t=1761876268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116980/extras/e05f9955484e7276d62f05739172e989.webm?t=1761876268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116980/extras/e05f9955484e7276d62f05739172e989.mp4?t=1761876268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Exclusive Character Card System!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>31 exclusive cards</strong> for the Prince</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116980/extras/41150928345aab2d55ed4a943d